sequenceDiagram
    participant Author as Evidence author
    participant API as RAG backend
    participant Curate as Golden-source corpus
    participant VDB as Vector index
    participant Eval as Retrieval evaluation
    participant Gen as Guardrailed generator
    participant TGA as Evidence package

    Author->>API: Ingredient / indication request
    API->>VDB: Retrieve candidate passages
    VDB-->>API: Ranked evidence
    API->>Eval: Score retrieval quality
    Eval-->>API: Pass / remediate
    API->>Gen: Generate with citations
    Gen->>Gen: Guardrails + output validation
    Gen-->>API: Draft package sections
    API-->>Author: Evidence package for review
    Author->>TGA: TGA-ready documentation path
    Note over Curate,VDB: Licensed + open medical literature, curated before indexing
